# Key material. Everything here lives on the USB (see justfile) and must never
# reach the tree, but 'git add -A' after a stray copy is one keystroke away and
# this repo is public. The justfile names id_ed25519* by hand, so match that
# shape too - public halves are re-allowed, since allowed_signers and
# authorizedKeys are meant to be committed.
